<metadata><name>Ooredoo Doha Half Marathon 2027 (approximate)</name>
<desc>Traced from the published 21 km course map and placed on OpenStreetMap landmarks. Accurate to roughly 30 to 80 m, not surveyed. Length 21063 m against the official 21097 m. No elevation (Doha is flat). Use the organiser's official file if they publish one.</desc></metadata>
